   "feature": false,
   "image": "images/mcnally-mats.jpg",
   "memberText": "Advisor Brian McNally hosts A Morning on the Mats at Octagon MMA, Thursday 7:00-8:15 AM: boxing, jiu-jitsu and MMA basics with the pros, practical self-defense built for first-timers. Technique-focused, no hard sparring, all levels welcome. Coaches: Mitt Man Manny (pro combat coach; corners and camps for UFC, PFL, BKFC and Showtime Boxing) and Ryan 'Baby Face' Benoit (UFC flyweight veteran, eight career knockouts, fights out of Dallas). Ride leaves the Ritz lobby at 6:30 AM; back with time to shower before brunch. No fee: make a donation to The Boru Fund at brianmcnally.com/boru instead. Wear athletic shorts or joggers (no zippers), a fitted tee or rash guard, sneakers for warm-up, bring a water bottle and towel, jewelry off. A short liability waiver is signed on arrival. To get on the ride, text Brian: his number is in your agenda email.",
